nd GND.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(value \\\"0.1uF\\\") (footprint \\\"Inductor_SMD:L_0805_2012Metric_Pad1.05x1.20mm_HandSolder\\\")\"},\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"59\\\") (name \\\"unconnected-(C19-Pad1)\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\") (node (ref \\\"C19\\\") (pin \\\"1\\\") (pintype \\\"passive\\\")))\"}\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The part is a dangling capacitor with no effect on the circuit. The wrong footprint may also indicate a wrong part was placed, risking assembly mistakes.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.35\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"wrong_value\",\n      \"components\": [\"C12\"],\n      \"pins\": [\"C12.1\", \"C12.2\"],\n      \"nets\": [\"Net-(U7-A)\", \"Net-(Q3-D)\"],\n      \"observed\": \"C12 is 4.7uF/25V and sits between the Net-(U7-A) charge-pump node and the switch node Net-(Q3-D), not on the battery input.\",\n      \"expected\": \"The specification describes C12 as a 2.2 uF input capacitor on BAT+ to GND, and the input capacitor here is C5 (2.2uF) on NET0009.\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"source\": \"spec\", \"quote\": \"`C12` (2.2 \u00b5F) on `BAT+`\u2192GND is the input cap\"},\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(value \\\"4.7uF/25V\\\")\"},\n        {\"source\": \"spice\", \"quote\": \"C12 Net-_U7-A_ Net-_Q3-D_ 4.7uF\"}\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"A 4.7uF pump capacitor in place of the specified 2.2uF value changes the charge-pump and input-filter behaviour somewhat. The impact is likely minor, since this is a reference-designator and value mismatch rather than a short or open.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The main anomaly is SKW92A LAN_PORT3_TX+/- (pins 13 and 14) tied directly to the GND net, which shorts a differential transmit pair to ground. The C19 capacitor with an inductor footprint and a floating pad is a lower-confidence secondary finding.\"\n}",
